    },
}
```

This example demonstrates:
- Layered architecture with email interface and concrete sender.
- Dependency injection via a simple vtable interface (function pointers).
- Clear separation of business logic (`user_service`) and infrastructure (`email/smtp_sender`).
- Testing with a mock implementation that doesn’t require any framework.
- No hidden globals, no magic wiring.

